# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.*
**/.yarn/*
!**/.yarn/patches
!**/.yarn/plugins
!**/.yarn/releases
!**/.yarn/versions

# Build outputs
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
**/generated/prisma

# Environment & secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Logs & debug
**/*.log
**/logs/
**/npm-debug.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.pnpm-debug.log*

# OS & IDE
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/*
!**/.vscode/settings.json
!**/.vscode/tasks.json
!**/.vscode/launch.json
!**/.vscode/extensions.json
**/*.pem
**/.vercel
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts

# Temp
**/.temp/
**/.tmp/
**/report.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.json
